<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. Defence Secretary Hegseth traveled to Caracas and signed a new military partnership agreement with the interim Venezuelan government, expanding cooperation to target drug trafficking and positioning Venezuela as a compliant security partner. The deal was sealed during meetings with interim president and Delcy Rodriguez, while Colombia rejected a joint U.S. plan to target drug gangs, indicating regional tension over security initiatives. The United States also announced a Caribbean operation, during which a marine died after falling overboard. Two battle-related deaths occurred in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5sdjlJY1d2cXF0dk9rSEFlYTBDbC1wU2JrN1ZCcjNSTllsOEdWNldnUXhFQm5IdFpsb1VwVGRRZTJKTk11RVpuZm95b3JnaUFfNU1SNmplVXZnaHdxSXpPZjB4Vk1JR3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQaDk1dWVDTWtxcHkxQjE0dS1GVzZ1WXhpbmhyZkNDc0F2TlYteGpmLWxabEE2QXAwZnUwYmRKVzQ4aUlIUGFxZl9BUHM1NDJXUEhiUEUzaEJVaks1U1JYVkl4U2hsQWVLOVN0MUZQcFZqQ3VPSDBmLVhVSUZKZXl2bWpIZWRJQzJOS01femYwRlBCLXNPc2owa0t4SmFpWWZqSk5kRGJ1ZXIxcXByRFpMYmdWRHVpUlBhZGN2RA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPMnNkaGhTRmNHOWx1Vm9xa2pobVgzNTBxNEVyX0tjaDFfM29WWmt4QUIzRkF3U2NnT1lHVmdkSjgxTEFnU1RLTHdpLXpaTHIxLUpXTjkzbWlyQXR1WlN3cE5vY1E2LTVNNTJTTzAwOEVvcXF6WmJ5cEVfRnJVYVdXdGxHTlZ1empZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxONFk1RlZIUXh1dXlFVHVzSlh1YjVibG0wdV81RS1na0Ywc3p5MEhaOXB6YlREV3FFRzJpM1VhMFgzYnNLU3hvaXBXOUh4TkpXa01XYTRzS1o1R0VXcHhzZXc4ZkRZYUIxRVVpRXB6Zm9BRUNMQlE5aGFySVUzR2RpVmpsV1A2UFNSLTRITEZNVG5BdUlZ?oc=5&quot;&